UID:c3cd71992f901e94bfb0f62cea3fad2247209cc1@lewagon-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261005T232359Z
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Shows on Ice! First time in Bali
LOCATION:Nuanu Creative City\, Beraban\, Kediri\, Tabanan
DESCRIPTION:Bali’s First Ice Season at BLOCK42\, Nuanu For the first time
  in Bali\, BLOCK42\, Nuanu welcomes a spectacular season of live ice shows
 \, bringing together professional figure skating\, circus performance\, th
 eatre and immersive visual technology on a real ice rink built especially 
 for the occasion. The season features two large-scale productions: Aladdin
  and the Famous Stories from 1001 Nights on Ice (2 shows: 31 October 2026 
 starting at 16:00 and starting 19:00) takes audiences into the legendary w
 orld of Scheherazade\, Aladdin\, Ali Baba and Sinbad. Expect breathtaking 
 skating\, acrobatics\, daring jumps and spins\, fire juggling\, hula hoops
 \, magic tricks\, spectacular costumes and large-scale video projections i
 nspired by the atmosphere of the East. Alice in Wonderland on Ice (2 shows
 : 01 November 2026 starting at 13:00 and starting 16:00) reimagines Lewis 
 Carroll’s timeless story through figure skating\, circus artistry and im
 mersive digital scenography. Alice and the unforgettable characters of Won
 derland come to life through complex choreography\, acrobatics and strikin
 g visual effects that transform the venue into a surreal fantasy world. Tw
 o stories. Two spectacular productions. One ice rink in the heart of Bali.
  A unique live experience for families\, children and adults\, combining t
 he elegance of figure skating with the energy of contemporary circus and t
 he magic of theatre. How to Choose Your Show and Seats The performances ar
 e available on different dates and at different session times. Please sele
 ct your preferred session when purchasing your ticket. Each session corres
 ponds to a specific performance\, date and show — Aladdin and the Famous
  Stories from 1001 Nights on Ice or Alice in Wonderland on Ice. After sele
 cting your session\, you can use the venue seating plan to choose your pre
 ferred seating area and available seats. Please check the show title\, dat
 e and session time carefully before completing your booking\, as different
  sessions may feature different productions. Children Policy Children unde
 r 12 years old must be accompanied by a parent or responsible adult aged 1
 8 or over. Children aged 0–4 may attend with a Kids Ticket. This ticket 
 does not include a separate seat\, and the child must sit on the lap of th
 e accompanying adult during the performance. Children aged 5 years and abo
 ve require a regular ticket with their own seat. Ketentuan Anak Anak di ba
 wah usia 12 tahun wajib didampingi oleh orang tua atau orang dewasa yang b
 ertanggung jawab berusia 18 tahun ke atas. Anak usia 0–4 tahun dapat mas
 uk dengan Kids Ticket. Tiket ini tidak termasuk tempat duduk terpisah\, da
 n anak harus duduk di pangkuan orang dewasa yang mendampingi selama pertun
 jukan. Anak usia 5 tahun ke atas wajib memiliki tiket reguler dengan tempa
 t duduk sendiri. The Venue BLOCK42\, Nuanu\, Bali\, Indonesia Inside Nuanu
  Creative City BLOCK42 is located in Nuanu\, the creative city on Bali’s
  west coast. Please check the event page for the exact venue location\, en
 trance details and directions. A purpose-built ice arena The venue feature
 s a specially installed ice rink together with a full-scale production set
 up including professional lighting\, sound and large-format video projecti
 on — creating a complete theatrical ice-show experience. Doors open 1 ho
 ur before the show We recommend arriving early to allow enough time for en
 try and seating. Latecomers may be admitted during a suitable pause in the
  performance to avoid disturbing the audience. Parking & drop-off Drop-off
  and parking are available within Nuanu. Scooter parking is located close 
 to the venue entrance\, while car parking is available a short walk away. 
 Please allow additional time for parking and walking to BLOCK42 before the
  show. **Venue layout is indicative and may be subject to change without p
 rior notice. Tickets: https://megatix.co.id/events/shows-on-ice-first-time
 -in-bali\n\nMore info: https://baligasm.com/event/nuanu-creative-city-show
 s-on-ice-oct-2026\n\nPlease verify with the organizer before attending.
URL:https://baligasm.com/event/nuanu-creative-city-shows-on-ice-oct-2026
STATUS:CONFIRMED
DTSTART:20261031T000000Z
DTEND:20261031T010000Z
END:VEVENT
